<span begin="00:35.430" end="00:35.520">to </span><span begin="00:35.520" end="00:35.910">come </span><span begin="00:35.910" end="00:36.990">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.200" end="00:38.820"><span begin="00:37.200" end="00:37.470">And </span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.830">show </span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:38.010">you </span><span begin="00:38.010" end="00:38.370">that </span><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:38.520">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.820">with</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.720" end="00:41.910"><span begin="00:39.720" end="00:40.020">You </span><span begin="00:40.020" end="00:40.710">lied </span><span begin="00:40.710" end="00:40.890">to </span><span begin="00:40.890" end="00:41.910">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.970" end="00:44.700"><span begin="00:41.970" end="00:42.180">All </span><span begin="00:42.180" end="00:42.450">those </span><span begin="00:42.450" end="00:42.840">times </span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:42.990">I </span><span begin="00:42.990" end="00:43.350">said </span><span begin="00:43.350" end="00:43.680">that </span><span begin="00:43.680" end="00:43.920">I </span><span begin="00:43.920" end="00:44.310">loved </span><span begin="00:44.310" end="00:44.700">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.730" end="00:46.830"><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:45.000">You </span><span begin="00:45.000" end="00:45.720">lied </span><span begin="00:45.720" end="00:45.900">to </span><span begin="00:45.900" end="00:46.830">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.860" end="00:49.770"><span begin="00:46.860" end="00:47.190">Yes</span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:47.190">, </span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:47.370">I </span><span begin="00:47.370" end="00:48.150">tried</span><span begin="00:48.150" end="00:48.180">, </span><span begin="00:48.180" end="00:48.480">yes</span><span begin="00:48.480" end="00:48.480">, </span><span begin="00:48.480" end="00:48.660">I </